<h2>👨‍💼 Employee Management System</h2>
📌 Project Overview
The Employee Management System is a simple Python-based project designed to manage employee information efficiently. It allows users to add, view, update, and delete employee records.

🚀 Features
➕ Add new employee details
📋 View all employee records
✏️ Update employee information
🗑️ Delete employee records
🔍 Search employee details
💾 Store and manage employee data
🛠️ Technologies Used
Programming Language: Python
Database: [File Handling]
IDE: VS Code / PyCharm
